 299:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_tim.c ****   if((TIMx == TIM1) || (TIMx == TIM8)||
 300:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_tim.c ****      (TIMx == TIM2) || (TIMx == TIM3)||
