 749:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_tim.c ****   *         peripheral.
 750:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_tim.c ****   * @param  TIM_OCInitStruct: pointer to a TIM_OCInitTypeDef structure that contains
 751:./Libraries/src/stm32f4xx_tim.c ****   *         the configuration information for the specified TIM peripheral.
